Grammar

    0 $accept: file $end

    1 var_decl_list1: var_decl_list1 ',' var_decl
    2               | var_decl

    3 var_decl_list: var_decl_list1
    4              | ε

    5 value_list1: value_list1 ',' value
    6            | value

    7 value_list: value_list1
    8           | ε

    9 lit_object: '{' value_list '}'

   10 lit_array: '[' value_list ']'

   11 value: lit_string
   12      | lit_int
   13      | lit_float
   14      | lit_object
   15      | lit_array
   16      | var_name

   17 type_def: _typedef var_name '(' var_decl_list ')'

   18 var_assign: var_name '=' value
   19           | var_decl '=' value

   20 var_decl: type var_name
   21         | var_name var_name

   22 instruction: comment
   23            | comments
   24            | var_decl
   25            | var_assign
   26            | type_def

   27 instructions: instructions instruction
   28             | ε

   29 file: instructions


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    '(' (40) 17
    ')' (41) 17
    ',' (44) 1 5
    '=' (61) 18 19
    '[' (91) 10
    ']' (93) 10
    '{' (123) 9
    '}' (125) 9
    error (256)
    comment <vstring> (258) 22
    comments <vstring> (259) 23
    type <vstring> (260) 20
    _typedef <vstring> (261) 17
    lit_string <vstring> (262) 11
    lit_int <vstring> (263) 12
    lit_float <vstring> (264) 13
    var_name <vstring> (265) 16 17 18 20 21


Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

    $accept (19)
        on left: 0
    var_decl_list1 <varray> (20)
        on left: 1 2
        on right: 1 3
    var_decl_list <varray> (21)
        on left: 3 4
        on right: 17
    value_list1 <varray> (22)
        on left: 5 6
        on right: 5 7
    value_list <varray> (23)
        on left: 7 8
        on right: 9 10
    lit_object (24)
        on left: 9
        on right: 14
    lit_array (25)
        on left: 10
        on right: 15
    value <vstring> (26)
        on left: 11 12 13 14 15 16
        on right: 5 6 18 19
    type_def <varray> (27)
        on left: 17
        on right: 26
    var_assign <varray> (28)
        on left: 18 19
        on right: 25
    var_decl <varray> (29)
        on left: 20 21
        on right: 1 2 19 24
    instruction <varray> (30)
        on left: 22 23 24 25 26
        on right: 27
    instructions <varray> (31)
        on left: 27 28
        on right: 27 29
    file (32)
        on left: 29
        on right: 0


